1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Nobody opened this 4,000-year-old letter. We read it anyway.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,500
Kültepe, the ancient city of Kanesh, in Anatolia

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:11,500
Cuneiform tablets, still sealed inside clay envelopes

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:15,500
The clay envelopes have never been broken open

5
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:21,000
A portable CT scanner sees through the clay

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,000
From a woman named Anna-anna

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Her husband, a merchant

8
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Sealed for 4,000 years. Read without a single crack.
